GraphArena [36]. GraphArena samples subgraphs from real-world graphs, including knowledge
graphs, social networks, and molecular structures. The tasks include four polynomial-time tasks,
Common Neighbor, Shortest Distance, Connected Component, Graph Diameter, and six NP-complete
tasks, Maximum Clique Problem (MCP), Maximum Independent Set (MIS), Minimum Vertex Cover
(MVC), Maximum Common Subgraph (MCS), Graph Edit Distance (GED), and Traveling Salesman
Problem (TSP). Each problem is contextualized within the real-world setting of the graph with an
example presented as below:
