LLMs as decoder
Mini-GPT4 (Zhu et al., 2023b) ✔ ✗ - ✗
LLaV A (Liu et al., 2023b) ✔ ✗ - ✗
Video-ChatGPT (Maaz et al., 2023) ✗ ✔ - ✗
